# Bristlepack Sentry: "as long as you control a creature with power 4 or greater" (CR 702.3b): Bot2's Drover Grizzly (power 4) is not Bot1's, so the
# Sentry still has defender on T3 and cannot be declared as an attacker, though Bot1's Llanowar Elves can.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Bristlepack Sentry
Llanowar Elves
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Drover Grizzly
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Bristlepack Sentry.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Drover Grizzly.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
! Bot1.Attack(Bristlepack Sentry > Bot2)
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Drover Grizzly.Power = 4
Bot2.Life = 19
